Name:Rules pilot 218 - Suspending is not casting
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Easy
Description:You control Rule of Law and four Mountains, and have Shivan Meteor (suspend 2 - {1}{R}{R}) and Lightning Bolt in hand. End the turn with Shivan Meteor suspended and the opponent at 17 life.
Rule:rulesguru-e0cbcd7e6781c18b | Suspending a card is a special action, not casting a spell (CR 702.62a, 116.2f), so it does not count toward Rule of Law's one spell: suspend Shivan Meteor and cast Lightning Bolt
